+/-!
+The kernel's `is_geq` must strip a common `succ` offset when the two sides have different
+offsets, as `Level.geq` does: `imax (w+1) w + 1 ≤ w + 2` for every `w`.
+-/
+universe u w
+
+inductive J (β : Sort (imax (w+1) w + 1)) : Sort (w+2)
+  | mk : β → J β
+
+inductive J' (β : Sort (max (imax (w+1) w + 1) (w+1))) : Sort (max (w+3) u)
+  | mk : β → J' β
